{% set L = light_photos %}
<section id="day" class="light" data-light="noon" aria-labelledby="light-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="light-head">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker reveal">A day on the grounds</p>
        <h2 id="light-title" class="reveal d1">Noon to midnight, <em>yours.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="light-ctl" role="group" aria-label="Time of day">
        <button type="button" data-light="noon" aria-pressed="true">Noon</button>
        <button type="button" data-light="golden" aria-pressed="false">Golden hour</button>
        <button type="button" data-light="night" aria-pressed="false">Night</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="light-grid">
      <div class="ph light-stage">
        {% for key in ['noon', 'golden', 'night'] %}{% set pname = L[key] %}<img class="light-img{% if loop.first %} on{% endif %}" data-light="{{ key }}" src="{{ photos[pname].src }}" srcset="{{ photos[pname].srcset }}" sizes="(min-width: 861px) 58vw, 100vw" width="{{ photos[pname].width }}" height="{{ photos[pname].height }}" alt="{{ photos[pname].alt }}" style="object-position: {{ photos[pname].focal }}" {% if not loop.first %}loading="lazy"{% endif %} decoding="async">{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="light-aside">
        <div class="light-note" data-light="noon">
          <p class="light-time">{{ v.day.gates_open }}</p>
          <h3>Gates open.</h3>
          <p>The standard rental is {{ v.day.rental_hours }} hours including breakdown, and the gates open at {{ v.day.gates_open|lower }}. Ceremony under the fig in the Flower Garden, or in the Bamboo Garden for a smaller circle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="light-note" data-light="golden" hidden>
          <p class="light-time">Golden hour</p>
          <h3>Cocktails, then the terrace.</h3>
          <p>The Bamboo Garden takes a cocktail hour of up to 120. The grand terrace looks out over the mini desert garden and its cactus beds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="light-note" data-light="night" hidden>
          <p class="light-time">{{ v.day.event_end }}</p>
          <h3>Dinner under glass.</h3>
          <p>The Greenhouse holds up to 200 and is HVAC climate-controlled. Events end at {{ v.day.event_end }}, with breakdown until midnight. Valet, a site manager, luxe restrooms and security are included.</p>
        </div>
        <ul class="light-sched" aria-label="The rental day">
          <li><b>{{ v.day.gates_open }}</b> Gates open</li>
          <li><b>{{ v.day.event_end }}</b> Event ends</li>
          <li><b>{{ 'Midnight' if v.day.breakdown_end == '12 AM' else v.day.breakdown_end }}</b> Breakdown complete</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
